{"v":4,"catch":"激烈的動作恐怖體驗！","desc":"“SPLATTER HOUSE”是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1988 年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n控制英雄Rick，利用面具中的精神力量，穿越被詛咒的豪宅，解救女友Jennifer。\n擊退無情的怪物，活著離開鬼屋！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-06-22","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31c39e1a245bc5d075b8a907f7255d3e0c8c64350e1324c5948adb2b8975b27c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82db489a6e36e1a109f44aea51302510cc1e7a8e668fc81643377de22ed8c3b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b665e6a454bac2a67f2b6046ec251c3dbf85372e7e1bfb9b5fc2531d633144f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73859df713feab331e1713f78214d042ba731aab3a03dd1d283ffd2832baa7f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0744561be0623af672d370f1cabcdece4a97a5d5fd6efa65ee4cf4a2f73eb3b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb49e8cd3041f7e7dfbf95431963dd25ac446a551484a0cc7f31f268b04daa25.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d3601a682000","dlc":[]}